{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52341","headline":"诗（幷序） 一○二 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 一○二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生不吃着，於身一世错。\n一日命终时，拔釜交樛杓。\n若有大官职，身苦妻儿乐。\n叉手立公庭，终朝并[两]（雨）脚。\n得禄奴婢飡，请赐妻儿着。\n一日事参差，独自煞你却。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}